cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this repository, please cite it as below."
title: "Explainable Multimodal Pneumonia Classification"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: "Reddy"
    given-names: "M. Kshitiz"
    affiliation: "Bennett University"
repository-code: "https://github.com/mkshitizreddy-ctrl/multimodal-xai-diagnostic"
license: MIT
abstract: >-
  DenseNet-121 with CBAM/SE attention for chest X-ray pneumonia classification, evaluated on a
  patient-disjoint, deduplicated split, with synthetic-tabular fusion, Grad-CAM localization and
  counterfactual explanations, and a Streamlit dashboard. Research code; not a medical device.
keywords:
  - pneumonia
  - chest X-ray
  - explainable AI
  - Grad-CAM
  - multimodal learning
